7. Feature engineering

Feature engineering means creating useful input variables from raw data using domain knowledge.

For banking data, examples include:

Raw data	                      Engineered feature
Monthly income and monthly     debt	Debt-to-income ratio
Transaction timestamps	       Transactions per hour
Transaction amounts	Average    transaction amount
Missed payment history	       Missed payments in the last 6 months
Account opening date         	Account age in days
